{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">想在家燉出一盅媲美餐廳水準的滋補湯水？在無綫節目《阿爺廚房》中，鼎爺（李家鼎）親自示範了一道老少咸宜的養顏佳品——「蜜瓜螺頭花膠燉湯」。此湯精髓在於巧用乾螺頭與急凍螺頭「雙重提鮮」，湯水鮮甜濃郁，絕對是潤膚養顏的最佳選擇！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1b2b4883-3db2-4d41-afd6-ed4f7301edaa.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20263EaVwzp2Jv1785813916.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1b2b4883-3db2-4d41-afd6-ed4f7301edaa.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">所需食材</h4><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蜜瓜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">乾螺頭</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">急凍螺頭</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">花膠</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">瘦肉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雞</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雞腳</p></li></ul><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">烹調步驟</h4><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2df0711e-2442-4de0-bd8f-0fc347bfc996.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026xXfXq0DwFw1785813924.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2df0711e-2442-4de0-bd8f-0fc347bfc996.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\">小貼士</h4><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T09:20:06.855955+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}